  "solution": {
    "text": "Since the given equation has no real solution.<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Clearly, for infinite values of <math><mi>m</mi></math> given condition is true."
